      "de": "Ein Zweit- oder Ferienobjekt",
      "en": "A second home or holiday property",
      "en_draft": true
     },
     "why": "Not a primary residence, so no Vorsorge capital may be used — the whole deposit is hard equity. Lenders also require more of it than for a home the member lives in, and the 30 % here is the common floor rather than a rule with a statute behind it."
