     "value": "let_to_someone_else",
     "label": {
      "de": "Ich vermiete es",
      "en": "I let it out",
      "en_draft": true
     },
     "why": "An investment property, not a residence, so again no Vorsorge capital. Lenders commonly want a quarter down and assess the rent conservatively rather than counting it in full."
